# P4: Parts on Tracker+ and Mini. Shift + Song opens the Parts view, Rec = Build, Insert adds Part 1 from Pattern 1 and a copy of it, a Part has a
# length (Shift + pad 13), F3 goes to the start and F2 plays the song: the header names the Part.
# Rec again leaves Build before F3 / F2 (P8: in Build the F-row is the track buttons, a tap there turned tracks 3 and 2 Off in Part 2 and
# the closing Play started the playback instead of stopping it). Play stops the song.
title: Parts arrange and play on Tracker+ (P4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

tap Pattern
wait 800ms
press Shift
wait 200ms
tap Song
wait 250ms
release Shift
wait 1000ms
expect text "Parts - ARRANGE"
shot parts-arrange
tap Rec
wait 800ms
tap Insert
wait 1000ms
tap Insert
wait 1000ms
shot parts-two
tap Rec
wait 800ms
tap F3
wait 800ms
tap F2
wait 2500ms
shot parts-play
tap Play
wait 600ms
# ends on the poke read (plus_flows.sh poke_ok, UISHOT_TRACE_PARTS): the Parts view, Build, 2 Parts, Arrange at Part 1, Part 1 played, stopped
